OL,3,GNEWSANurdle impact to be researched for
OL,4,Aa year
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearch into the effects of a
OL,7,Fmicroplastic spillage on sea-birds and
OL,8,Fmarine life will be carried out for the
OL,9,Fnext year after funding was secured.
OL,11,FA team working across Tyneside is doing
OL,12,Ftests to discover the impact the
OL,13,Fpellets, known as nurdles, have on
OL,14,Fanimals, birds and fish, as well as the
OL,15,Foverall spread.
OL,17,FTonnes of microplastics were spilled
OL,18,Finto the River Tyne on 19 July
OL,19,Ffollowing a collision between ships at
OL,20,Fthe Port of Tyne.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
