OL,3,GNEWSANurdle impact to be researched for
OL,4,Aa year
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth East England Beached Bird Surveys
OL,7,Fco-ordinator Dan Turner, who is leading
OL,8,Fthe research on dead sea-birds, said:
OL,9,F"This will be a long-term issue,
OL,10,Fsecuring the grant now gives us room to
OL,11,Fconduct more research not just in the
OL,12,FNorth East but worldwide."
